  "skillsPrompt": "\n\nThe following skills provide specialized instructions for specific tasks.\nUse the read tool to load a skill's file when the task matches its description.\nWhen a skill file references a relative path, resolve it against the skill directory (parent of SKILL.md / dirname of the path) and use that absolute path in tool commands.\n\n<available_skills>\n  <skill>\n    <name>brand-poster-creator</name>\n    <description>品牌海报全流程生成技能。从需求收集、版式锁定、文案策划、生图到交付清理的全链路协调器。触发词：品牌海报、海报生成、做张海报、节日海报、产品海报、春节海报、营销海报</description>\n    <location>~/.openclaw/workspace-design/skills/brand-poster-creator/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>brand-poster-distiller</name>\n    <description>用于把参考海报蒸馏为可复用的版式结构（骨架图+坐标表），并配套本地蒸馏库网页进行查看、搜索、筛选、编辑与按 ID 调用。</description>\n    <location>~/.openclaw/workspace-design/skills/brand-poster-distiller/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>dreamina-cli</name>\n    <description>即梦视频生成底层 CLI 封装。仅用于视频生成任务，不得用于图片生成。应由其他 skill（如 dreamina-reference-video）调用，不应被用户直接触发。</description>\n    <location>~/.openclaw/workspace-design/skills/dreamina-cli/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>dreamina-reference-video</name>\n    <description>Use when the user wants to reduce 视频抽卡, keep 角色一致性, build 角色板或身份板与故事板, use 即梦 CLI 或 dreamina 或 Seedance 或 全能参考, or turn one idea into a staged 多参考图视频流程 before正式生成视频.</description>\n    <location>~/.openclaw/workspace-design/skills/dreamina-reference-video/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>image-deglaze</name>\n    <description>基于参考图的高清重绘工具：用 AI 理解原图构图、风格、元素后，以更高质量重新生成。适合”基于草图生成高清成品”、”风格化高清重绘”、”低质量图片高清化（允许内容优化）”等场景。触发词：”参考图重绘”、”草图转高清”、”风格化重绘”、”提升画质（允许优化）”。不适合”完全保持原图内容去包浆”（那种需求请推荐 Real-ESRGAN、Magnific AI 等超分辨率工具）。调用 gpt-image2-gen 做整图重生。</description>\n    <location>~/.openclaw/workspace-design/skills/image-deglaze/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>product-photography-workflow</name>\n    <description>Use when users ask for product photography, product still-life images, white-background product shots, clean tabletop product visuals, or product-image generation based on real product photos and style references, especially when the same product may need multiple continued tasks over time.</description>\n    <location>~/.openclaw/workspace-design/skills/product-photography-workflow/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>psd-layered-rebuilder</name>\n    <description>Use when the user asks for 分层 PSD、拆 PSD、真分层、海报拆层、已有整图重建 PSD，或需要输出图层 PNG、manifest 与可打开 PSD。默认指向官方真分层交付，不是像素粗拆或抠图版 PSD。</description>\n    <location>~/.openclaw/workspace-design/skills/psd-layered-rebuilder/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>RunningHub</name>\n    <description>Use when the user mentions runninghub / RunningHub / RunningHub API, asks for RunningHub AI Applications or custom ComfyUI workflows by webappId, or uses Feishu shortcut trigger words: 创作中心, 视频魔法, 检查余额. Generate images, videos, audio, and 3D models via RunningHub API (294 endpoints). Do not use only when the user explicitly asks for a specific custom image_generate model/provider by name, such as WB万能图片 2.0.</description>\n    <location>~/.openclaw/workspace-design/skills/runninghub/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>video-expert-analyzer</name>\n    <description>Advanced video analysis and selection skill with AI-powered automatic scoring. Integrates Walter Murch&apos;s rules and dynamic weighting for professional-grade curation. Supports Bilibili, YouTube, Douyin (抖音), and Xiaohongshu (小红书). Use this skill whenever the user wants to analyze videos, score or rate scenes, extract best shots/highlights, evaluate video quality, curate clips, do competitor video analysis, or mentions terms like &quot;视频分析&quot;, &quot;镜头筛选&quot;, &quot;场景评分&quot;, &quot;视频拆解&quot;, &quot;精选片段&quot;, &quot;视频质量&quot;, &quot;镜头打分&quot;, &quot;素材挑选&quot; — even if they don&apos;t explicitly ask for &quot;expert analysis&quot;.</description>\n    <location>~/.openclaw/workspace-design/skills/video-expert-analyzer/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>xiangqingye-desigen</name>\n    <description>从 0 开始规划电商详情页工作流：3 阶段紧凑流程（策略 → 手稿 → 成稿），默认单张方形画板 1920x1920 4 列纵向排列全部屏，全局风格指南确保风格统一，项目化文件管理避免混乱。适用于详情页策划、详情页手稿、电商长图、移动端详情页、PC详情页、详情页生成与拼接。重点服务食品/烘焙/快消品，也可泛化到其他消费品。触发词包括：详情页、详情页手稿、电商长图、移动端详情页、PC详情页、详情页策划、详情页生成、详情页拼接。</description>\n    <location>~/.openclaw/workspace-design/skills/xiangqingye-desigen/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n</available_skills>",
